WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.168
New classmates and group work. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.168 --> 00:00:12.240
Group work means a small table with a few classmates and one job each.

3
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:18.696
We can ask for the written-instructions job. Notes are our friend.

4
00:00:18.696 --> 00:00:24.936
Saying less is fine. Doing our part well speaks for us.

5
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:31.368
If the group gets loud, we can say: can one person talk at a time.

6
00:00:31.368 --> 00:00:38.064
We do not have to be funny or loud to belong. Reliable is enough.

7
00:00:38.064 --> 00:00:44.040
If it is too much, asking the teacher for a moment alone is allowed.

8
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:50.880
After a few times, some faces become familiar, and familiar is easier.

9
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:59.088
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

